# Ignore everything in data/ by default — the source workbook in particular
# (`Global Law and Society Associations Directory *.csv`) has a "Personal /
# individual email" column that must never end up in public git history.
*

# Exceptions: no personal data, and worth tracking as the audit trail of every
# write this project has made to Wikidata (QID mappings + the QuickStatements
# files, with their inline reasoning, that produced them).
!.gitignore
!qids.json
!journal-qids.json
!socio-legal-associations.quickstatements.txt
!socio-legal-journals.quickstatements.txt
